# The build context is the project root (backend/Dockerfile copies from backend/ and policies/).
# Keep secrets, virtual environments and build output out of it: they would be sent to the daemon and could be
# copied into an image.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
frontend
outbox
eval
docs
db
k8s
